      "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "subtitle": "Quick answers to the most common questions from players and partners",
      "q1": "How can I partner and list my sports venue on PlayGrid?",
      "a1": "It's simple! Select 'Venue Owner & Partner' in the contact form or call our hotline 1900 6868. Our team will review your facility, configure your courts layout, and activate your system within 24 hours.",
      "q2": "What is the cancellation and refund policy for court bookings?",
      "a2": "Players can cancel bookings free of charge up to 6 hours before the reserved time (depending on venue terms). Refunds are credited to your PlayGrid wallet or bank account within 1-2 business days.",
      "q3": "Does PlayGrid support organizing large sports tournaments?",
      "a3": "Yes! PlayGrid provides an end-to-end tournament solution: from online player registration and automated brackets generation to real-time scorekeeping, referee assignments, and event media.",
      "q4": "Can I use PlayGrid on mobile without downloading from the App Store?",
      "a4": "Yes! PlayGrid is a Progressive Web App (PWA). Simply open our website in your mobile browser and select 'Add to Home Screen' for a fast, native-like experience."
